75
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:34,380
You're courting death !

76
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:39,260
Teleporting takes too much time,

77
00:05:39,950 --> 00:05:41,300
I'll have to blast my way through.

78
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:52,340
Senior Ancient Demon,

79
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:54,140
how long do you intend to watch !?

80
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:54,980
You...

81
00:05:55,230 --> 00:05:57,620
are going to die !

82
00:06:15,150 --> 00:06:17,060
You're 10 years late

83
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:19,140
and still dare to order me around ?

84
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:21,060
I beg Senior for help.

85
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:22,380
Bei Luo,

86
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:24,620
