87
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:25,940
This is my territory,

88
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:28,820
you have no right to order me.

89
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:32,860
Lend me your blood.

90
00:06:42,470 --> 00:06:43,740
Bei Luo...

91
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:46,420
Do you dare to stop me ?

92
00:06:58,110 --> 00:07:00,750
I would've stopped if the Ancient Devil had come.

93
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:05,740
But you are just one of the nine Scattered Devils of the Ancient Devil.

94
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:07,820
Who do you think you are !?

95
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:08,580
Senior,

96
00:07:08,910 --> 00:07:09,540
10 years ago...

97
00:07:09,550 --> 00:07:10,140
Shut up !

98
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:11,940
Heal yourself.

99
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:08,620
Their spells

100
00:08:08,990 --> 00:08:11,340
are somewhat similar to Ancient God spells.

101
00:08:14,670 --> 00:08:18,820
The Ancient Demon, Ancient Devil, and Ancient God clans

102
00:08:18,990 --> 00:08:21,340
all originate from the Ancient Order.

103
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:25,460
This is an opportunity for you to comprehend their Dao.

104
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:26,980
Watch carefully.

105
00:08:36,790 --> 00:08:39,980
Ancient Gods are neither Demon nor Devil.

106
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:44,060
In their palms lies the power to shatter space.

107
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:57,070
This fight between the Ancient Demon and the Scattered Devil

108
00:08:57,070 --> 00:08:59,540
has allowed me to understand some Ancient God spells.

109
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:01,910
The benefits for my original body

110
00:09:01,950 --> 00:09:03,060
are inestimable.

111
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:06,510
3 days later

112
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:16,340
I finally finished refining

113
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,540
the 4 drops of Celestial Wine.

114
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:21,990
But this fight between the Ancient Demon and the Scattered Devil

115
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,540
is very strange.

116
00:09:25,350 --> 00:09:27,470
The Ancient Demon seems to be hitting lethal strikes each time

117
00:09:27,470 --> 00:09:29,140
but in reality, he's holding back.

118
00:09:30,150 --> 00:09:31,060
Could he...

119
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:32,860
be showing him mercy ?

120
00:09:33,350 --> 00:09:34,100
Bei Luo,

121
00:09:34,390 --> 00:09:36,700
is fighting me to the death over an ant

122
00:09:36,950 --> 00:09:38,140
worth it ?

123
00:09:39,470 --> 00:09:40,660
I don't need

124
00:09:41,430 --> 00:09:43,340
to explain to you why I do it.

125
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:45,740
You fool !

126
00:09:46,070 --> 00:09:48,380
Master won't let you off !

127
00:09:49,750 --> 00:09:51,660
So he is wary of the Ancient Devil.

128
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:54,060
But if this mad dog escapes,

129
00:09:54,310 --> 00:09:56,540
he'll likely come back for me to the ends of the world.

130
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:59,910
Since there's no way to resolve this matter peacefully anymore,

131
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,180
I must act thoroughly.

132
00:10:06,910 --> 00:10:08,020
Billion-Soul Flag

133
00:10:08,710 --> 00:10:09,980
enter the Underworld River !

134
00:10:16,230 --> 00:10:17,020
Xu Liguo !

135
00:10:20,830 --> 00:10:21,580
Th...This is...

136
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:24,140
M...Master...

137
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:28,140
If I can help Master slay this Devil,

138
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:29,540
it's worth it !

139
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,430
Now...

140
00:10:32,830 --> 00:10:35,220
I'll play all my cards

141
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:38,260
