142
00:10:46,950 --> 00:10:48,660
Although I, Wang Lin, am weak,

143
00:10:49,430 --> 00:10:51,860
I'm not someone you can mess with !

144
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:11,340
As long as you stay behind him,

145
00:11:11,750 --> 00:11:13,180
he'll have endless fuel.

146
00:11:17,830 --> 00:11:20,060
Yet, you dare to come to me yourself ?

147
00:11:20,430 --> 00:11:21,980
You're courting death !

148
00:11:31,230 --> 00:11:33,540
You nearly killed me before

149
00:11:34,190 --> 00:11:36,580
and forced me to flee for 3000 li !

150
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,660
I will make you pay

151
00:11:40,750 --> 00:11:42,540
blood for blood !

152
00:11:45,830 --> 00:11:47,620
With your level of cultivation,

153
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:49,740
what can you do to me !?

154
00:11:52,470 --> 00:11:53,020
This is...

155
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:56,540
a chaotic power blending Divine Sense and his comprehension of the Dao  !

156
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,940
My Divine Sense is unstable

157
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:04,380
and I've lost the Demon Tower.

158
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:06,150
I shouldn't fight any longer.

159
00:12:06,270 --> 00:12:07,740
Although my body was destroyed,

160
00:12:07,950 --> 00:12:09,740
I can always make a comeback

161
00:12:09,870 --> 00:12:11,940
as long as the armor remains.

162
00:12:12,430 --> 00:12:15,260
He knows he can't kill the Scattered Devil.

163
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:17,140
What is he trying to do ?

164
00:12:17,430 --> 00:12:18,460
You won't

165
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:20,020
be able to escape !

166
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:23,020
Without the Celestial Ascension Fruits,

167
00:12:23,350 --> 00:12:25,860
you can't withstand even a wisp of my devil soul !

168
00:12:27,630 --> 00:12:28,980
Who told you

169
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:30,820
that my Celestial Ascension Fruits

170
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:33,260
are all used up ?

171
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:52,020
Do you think you can fight me

172
00:12:52,230 --> 00:12:54,340
with your meager comprehension of the Dao !?

173
00:12:58,510 --> 00:12:59,940
It's just some remnants !

174
00:12:59,990 --> 00:13:01,940
So what if they blocked my devil soul once ?

175
00:13:02,470 --> 00:13:04,460
Since you're determined to die,

176
00:13:04,750 --> 00:13:05,860
then even if

177
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:07,860
I have to sacrifice some of my cultivation,

178
00:13:07,870 --> 00:13:10,540
I will possess you for sure !

179
00:13:11,470 --> 00:13:13,380
The final move

180
00:13:14,390 --> 00:13:15,500
relies on

181
00:13:16,470 --> 00:13:19,540
me not being alone.

182
00:13:27,950 --> 00:13:29,420
Well played, Wang Lin.

183
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:31,540
You used yourself as bait

184
00:13:31,590 --> 00:13:34,060
to trap the Scattered Devil within your Origin Soul

185
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:36,060
and force me to intervene.

186
00:13:36,990 --> 00:13:38,340
If I help you,

187
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:39,790
I will fulfill your wish.

188
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:41,140
If I don't help you,

189
00:13:41,310 --> 00:13:43,260
these 3 days of fighting

190
00:13:43,790 --> 00:13:46,340
would've been in vain.

191
00:13:47,070 --> 00:13:49,380
Since you predicted I would help,

192
00:13:49,590 --> 00:13:51,860
then this is your good fortune.

193
00:13:55,230 --> 00:13:58,310
Cloud Sky Sect
Planet Suzaku

194
00:14:17,190 --> 00:14:18,500
Is he the one

195
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:20,020
from that legend ?

196
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:24,020
He entered the Celestial Realm,

197
00:14:24,430 --> 00:14:25,870
beat Red Butterfly,

198
00:14:26,230 --> 00:14:27,740
fought Qian Feng.

199
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:29,540
All by himself,

200
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:32,820
he shook the entire planet Suzaku.

201
00:14:32,950 --> 00:14:34,860
Then why didn't he become the Suzaku ?

202
00:14:34,950 --> 00:14:36,260
That's the highest position !

203
00:14:39,110 --> 00:14:40,460
His path

204
00:14:40,830 --> 00:14:43,180
lies beyond the sea of stars.

205
00:14:58,070 --> 00:14:59,140
The rain has stopped.

206
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:04,540
May he protect our clan and grant us peace and prosperity.

207
00:15:05,590 --> 00:15:06,940
These candles

208
00:15:07,190 --> 00:15:09,940
are the lights we send for him.

209
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:13,670
Wang Lin's
Sea of Consciousness

210
00:15:12,070 --> 00:15:13,430
After months of cultivating,

211
00:15:13,630 --> 00:15:15,750
I finally stabilized my Ascendant cultivation.

212
00:15:16,310 --> 00:15:18,660
I can't fully refine this Devil for now

213
00:15:19,070 --> 00:15:20,940
but I can already suppress him

214
00:15:21,430 --> 00:15:23,060
with the help of the Ancient Demon.

215
00:15:23,670 --> 00:15:24,980
When the time comes,

216
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:27,340
I can refine him into my second Origin Soul.

217
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:30,820
As for this demon armor...

218
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:37,870
Dragon Pool
Sky Demon Country

219
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:45,180
If I use the Demonic Finger with this armor,

220
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:48,270
it would be even stronger than the Underworld River.

221
00:15:50,150 --> 00:15:51,140
Are you

222
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:53,140
leaving already ?

223
00:15:59,470 --> 00:16:01,140
The Ancient Demon has helped me multiple times

224
00:16:01,350 --> 00:16:02,830
at a considerable cost.

225
00:16:03,430 --> 00:16:04,940
If I leave now,

226
00:16:05,750 --> 00:16:07,660
he'll think I'm abandoning him.

227
00:16:08,310 --> 00:16:09,660
Senior has helped me 3 times,

228
00:16:09,990 --> 00:16:11,420
I will remember it.

229
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:13,270
The reason I'm leaving

230
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:15,030
is precisely to fulfill our agreement.

231
00:16:15,190 --> 00:16:16,540
But before that,

232
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:18,990
I would like to ask Senior's help with something.

233
00:16:19,470 --> 00:16:20,460
Speak...

234
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:23,900
Can senior help me find an old friend ?

235
00:16:24,550 --> 00:16:26,500
His Divine Sense is on this pagoda.

236
00:16:34,230 --> 00:16:36,870
There's no such Sword Spirit in the Sky Demon Country.

237
00:16:37,070 --> 00:16:39,460
If you want me to search the entire Demon Spirit Land,

238
00:16:39,670 --> 00:16:42,220
you must first retrieve a Demon Spirit for me.

239
00:16:44,470 --> 00:16:45,140
Agreed.

240
00:16:48,550 --> 00:16:51,510
This person is definitely connected to Sword Saint Ling Tianhou.

241
00:16:51,950 --> 00:16:53,740
Keeping him could come in use later.

242
00:16:54,870 --> 00:16:55,740
Two more things.

243
00:16:56,070 --> 00:16:56,990
First,

244
00:16:56,990 --> 00:16:58,140
I want this person.

245
00:16:58,710 --> 00:16:59,490
Second,

246
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:00,950
I want to enter the Ancient Demon inheritance

247
00:17:00,950 --> 00:17:02,140
to refine my spells.

248
00:17:04,190 --> 00:17:05,580
I can give you the person

249
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:07,620
but for the Ancient Demon inheritance...

250
00:17:09,230 --> 00:17:10,350
If within 100 years,

251
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:12,380
you can obtain a Demon Spirit,

252
00:17:12,790 --> 00:17:14,260
then we'll discuss it.

253
00:17:15,230 --> 00:17:16,030
Okay.

254
00:17:16,550 --> 00:17:17,940
But with just my strength,

255
00:17:18,070 --> 00:17:19,220
it will be difficult.

256
00:17:19,990 --> 00:17:21,140
From now on,

257
00:17:21,470 --> 00:17:23,420
you are my Sky Demon Envoy.

258
00:17:23,950 --> 00:17:25,620
Your identity is higher than the Demon Emperor.

259
00:17:26,510 --> 00:17:29,620
My Sky Demon Country will officially wage war to the Fire Demon Country.

260
00:17:30,430 --> 00:17:31,980
You will use this opportunity

261
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:33,660
to approach the Fire Demon Spirit.

262
00:17:34,390 --> 00:17:35,460
I will fulfill my mission

263
00:17:35,830 --> 00:17:36,940
within 100 years.

264
00:17:41,160 --> 00:20:15,070
After the Blood Soul Pill absorbs a trace of Divine Sense and blood, it also activates another ability for a short period of time. At the moment of death, anything that is linked to the Origin Soul will be merged with the void. After one is resurrected, they can use the power of their soul and blood to retrieve the items stored in the void.

That small glimpse at planet Suzaku is a whole chapter in the novel where we learn that Zhou Ru has become some kind of princess of planet Suzaku and has reached Core Formation. She is protected by Chi Hu the new Patriarch of the Giant Demon Clan, Yunque Zi of the Forsaken Immortal Clan, Zhou Wutai the Suzaku and Little White the tiger.

265
00:18:02,190 --> 00:18:07,670
Ask

266
00:18:03,710 --> 00:18:05,510
Qi Condensation

267
00:18:04,630 --> 00:18:07,670
the perilous path filled with countless blades.

268
00:18:07,150 --> 00:18:08,790
Foundation Establishment

269
00:18:08,310 --> 00:18:14,470
Can the mundane world be shattered

270
00:18:09,670 --> 00:18:12,110
Core Formation

271
00:18:12,870 --> 00:18:15,550
Nascent Soul

272
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:14,470
by a child's steadfast heart ?

273
00:18:14,590 --> 00:18:20,710
If the laws of this world

